    {'The partial 2020s data suggests the downward trend is continuing.' if d20 and d20 < d10 else 'The 2020s show a modest reversal, though the decade is incomplete and coverage varies.'}
    These averages should be interpreted in light of the changing composition of reporting countries across decades.
