    <li><strong>Sub-Saharan Africa:</strong> Several nations in this region also appear among the highest rates, though data coverage is often limited.</li>
    <li><strong>Europe and East Asia:</strong> These regions account for most of the lowest-rate countries, with rates frequently below 1 per 100,000.</li>
