<!-- ─── SECTION 5: NOTABLE TRENDS & OUTLIERS ────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="section" id="notable-trends">
  <h2>5. Notable Country-Level Trends &amp; Outliers</h2>

  <p>
    Beyond the global averages, individual country trajectories reveal remarkable variation.
    This section highlights countries with the most dramatic improvements and deteriorations
    in homicide rates over the observation period. Only countries with at least 5 years of data
    spanning a minimum of 10 years are considered, to ensure statistical reliability.
  </p>

  <div class="chart-container">
